{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026jVeRCBseqX1795527140.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>海關搗破一個透過通訊群組售賣冒牌貨的集團，檢獲1,500件懷疑冒牌物品，市值43萬元。行動檢獲冒牌童裝、鞋等。</p><p></p><p>海關早前接獲市民舉報，指有人透過通訊應用程式售賣懷疑冒牌貨，調查後發現不法集團針對家庭客戶群組，訛稱「平行進口」誘騙市民。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.APPS-1700_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026bGR0uStk9l1795527149.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>海關早前展開行動，突擊搜查尖東一個商廈單位，搜出懷疑冒牌物品，並拘捕一名39歲女子，再在火炭及元朗搗破兩個倉庫。海關提醒市民網購要加強警覺。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T13:43:55.899904+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":188,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T09:13:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T12:37:14.162810+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T13:37:17.139197+00:00","content_hash":"84ee9d2fcf7bc4f99348e03b99c9d7fcd6e1c4b701392b1c26933cbb828b17de","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T13:43:55.899904+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}